# Admin Panel Rules

## Scope

- Routes live at `/admin/*` — **not** under `[locale]`
- Single language (English) for admin UI
- Mutations via Server Actions only — no business logic in page components

## Authentication

- `requireAdminSession()` on all panel routes (except `/admin/login`)
- scrypt password hashing — `src/features/admin/server/password.ts`
- Sessions in `admin_sessions` with hashed token; HttpOnly signed cookie
- `ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET` via `serverEnv` — never bare `process.env`
- Bootstrap first user: `pnpm admin:create`

## Location CRUD

- Re-validate hierarchy with `assertValidParent()` on every save
- Hotel forms: city selector drives filtered district selector
- Hotel list: support search, city filter, district filter, active/inactive
- Never expose `REGION` type in admin UI

## Pricing

- Matrix shows **districts only** as destinations
- Hotels must not appear in pricing editor

## Reservations

- Display origin, pricing destination (district), and actual drop-off separately
- Drop-off label comes from `snapshot_dropoff_label`

## Forbidden

- Adding third-party auth libraries without ADR
- Admin routes inside `[locale]`
- Skipping session check on destructive actions
- Returning customer PII in public APIs from admin code paths
